From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maplibre-plugins <sync@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:27:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Carry plugin feature layout properties

Feature and composite expressions for plugin layout properties, evaluated
per feature during tile layout, and the tile id in the layout context.

Carried by maplibre-plugins until it lands upstream.
